ga_b(){return"Before a code is emailed, a Cloudflare anti-bot check (Turnstile) reads your IP address and information about your browser. The relay also asks Cloudflare whether the domain of your address (what follows the @) receives email; neither your full address nor your IP address goes there. To curb abuse, the relay also counts requests per email address and per IP address, in an unreadable form erased the next day. These protections rest on the legitimate interest in protecting the service."},
